  "sourceOfTruth": "skills@1.7.0 npm package, dist/cli.mjs `const agents` object (one entry per agent: skillsDir, globalSkillsDir, detectInstalled). Refreshed from the 1.5.9 table, which was absorbed from git branch archive/rust-gui src/agents.rs SPECS; pathSemantics and detectionOrder below describe Sukiru's detector and still cite that port.",
